  "src": "black gap regions between horizontally separated 4-connected red rectangular objects",
  "transform": "recolor a gap to maroon across the shared row span of its two red rectangles when no third red bbox crosses both that gap and shared span; preserve all red pixels and other black pixels"
}
</annotation>
